},{"client_msg_id":"c006c9bc-27fd-4f67-bb44-ad64a53e6c61","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/gina.vim/issues/290\u003e","ts":"1632435620.001900","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/gina.vim/issues/290|#290 [commit] :wq prompts after vim 8.2.2900\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/gina.vim/issues/290|#290 [commit] :wq prompts after vim 8.2.2900\u003e","text":"Using `:wq` on gina-buffer-commit feature, gina is expected not to show confirmation prompt.\n\n```\nDo you want to commit changes? (Y[es]/n[o]):\n\n```\n\nHowever, starting from \u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/1174b018a6d705ddb8c04f3d21f78ae760aa0856|vim 8.2.2900\u003e, which fixes the issue \u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/8279|vim/vim#8279\u003e, the plugin starts to show confirmation prompt.  \nIt seems that the commit in Vim breaks the assumption of gina at\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/gina.vim/blob/97116f338f304802ce2661c2e7c0593e691736f8/autoload/gina/command/tag/edit.vim#L111|gina.vim/autoload/gina/command/tag/edit.vim\u003e\n\nLine 111 in \u0026lt;/lambdalisue/gina.vim/commit/97116f338f304802ce2661c2e7c0593e691736f8|97116f3\u0026gt;\n\n.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"bug","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"5","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/gina.vim|lambdalisue/gina.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1623399567}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tocM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9945c1d7-37a6-4812-aad0-ca3ca58fa759","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ginaの実装みてると、どうも `:wq` のときはこのconfirmがでないはずなのに、なぜかでるようになった。`vim 8.2.3441` now. Vim本体があやしいな...","ts":"1632435569.001700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7l1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"add4107f-aebf-4816-9f1d-571fb581d7ab","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ginaの :Gina commit のバッファを `:wq` すると前までそのままコミットしてくれてたのが、なぜか `Do you want to commit changes?` のconfirmがでるようになったので調査中","ts":"1632435522.000900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"34D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"affa4336-7370-44f5-b291-25470ed7f031","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"むー","ts":"1632435481.000000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sumi","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+onr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbc4e36e-eb47-496a-9828-e7130cddbe9c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーん、そうか… `\u0026lt;C-r\u0026gt;=` とかを使うと `\"=` レジスタが汚染されるわけなんだけど、これをケアしているプラグインはほぼほぼない…私が作ってるのも含めて…","ts":"1632416305.499800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DxD4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a05ad8a4-c0e9-4b55-ac11-3edd0f5bc2eb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`=` レジスタ使うと yankround.vim バグるな…","ts":"1632415846.499000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o7Ts4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"136e7c58-3a00-4914-ab2c-9026e103a204","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/vimdoc-ja-working/pull/950\u003e\ndone","ts":"1632415559.498500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Ez4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1163e44c-7c37-4b59-bdfd-4d0578cd7ca0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"おなしゃす :pray:","ts":"1632414566.498300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pn0d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"710d7daf-0636-464f-9487-ddd1e5f1238d","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"そっちも含