                                                |getregtype()|.\n                                   visual       True if the operation is\n                                                performed on a |Visual| area.\n                                Not triggered when |quote_| is used nor when\n                                called recursively.\n                                It is not allowed to change the buffer text,\n                                see |textlock|.\n                                {only when compiled with the +eval feature}\n```","ts":"1632413877.492800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a1a32e05-33f3-4c49-b38e-56526fe59df8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h TextYankPost@en","ts":"1632413877.492700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a4mE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddfe91b6-8da8-4b45-a58f-e5d9a5dafb82","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"一瞬 Vim script かな？と思っちゃいましたw","ts":"1632413869.492400","thread_ts":"1632413784.491600","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zZJi"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"d1ba664d-9e4a-4e31-932b-2839ded1798d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なんでもletしてるのすごい","ts":"1632413784.491600","thread_ts":"1632413784.491600","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1632413815.000000"},"reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fj4p1"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"0e7acf86-fdf0-4842-a214-2ed9ab50692e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"同じところ見てたw これ訳が微妙な気がしますね","ts":"1632413823.492200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c9A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18511b88-fc3a